diff --git a/static-solo/README.md b/static-solo/README.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..0955574
--- /dev/null
+++ b/static-solo/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,30 @@
+# Static single-player build
+
+A build of OpenFront that runs entirely in the browser: solo games against AI
+nations and bots, with no game server and no account API. It can be hosted on
+any static file host (Vercel, GitHub Pages, Netlify, ...).
+
+```bash
+npm run inst
+BASE_PATH=/openfront ./static-solo/build.sh   # output in static/
+```
+
+- `BASE_PATH` is the URL prefix the site is served under.
+- `MAPS_BASE` is where map data is loaded from. It defaults to jsDelivr,
+  pinned to the upstream commit this build is based on, so the ~570 MB of
+  maps do not have to be hosted alongside the site.
+- `STATIC_SOLO_SOURCE_URL` is the "Source code" link in the footer.
+
+What `STATIC_SOLO=true` changes:
+
+- The home screen only offers Solo and Tutorial; lobbies, ranked, store,
+  clans, leaderboard and sign-in are hidden.
+- The lobby socket never connects, and account API requests are answered
+  locally by a small `fetch` shim in `index.html` so the client falls back to
+  its offline defaults.
+- Ads, ad-recovery and analytics scripts are removed.
+- The page URL stays on `BASE_PATH` during a game.
+- The all-rights-reserved assets in `proprietary/` are not used: the logo and
+  favicon are replaced with originals in `static-solo/overrides/`, the font
+  and alert sound with openly licensed files from `resources/`, and there is
+  no music.
diff --git a/static-solo/build.sh b/static-solo/build.sh
new file mode 100755
index 0000000..8ad9a06
--- /dev/null
+++ b/static-solo/build.sh
@@ -0,0 +1,29 @@
+#!/usr/bin/env bash
+# Build the static single-player site into static/.
+#
+#   BASE_PATH  URL prefix the site is served under (default: /openfront)
+#   MAPS_BASE  where map data is loaded from (default: jsDelivr, pinned to
+#              the upstream commit this fork is based on)
+set -euo pipefail
+cd "$(dirname "$0")/.."
+
+UPSTREAM_COMMIT="22722dfe9aa9a7d7c6fe1b3fb4ace58ed8282731"
+export STATIC_SOLO=true
+export GIT_COMMIT="$UPSTREAM_COMMIT"
+export CDN_BASE="${BASE_PATH:-/openfront}"
+export MAPS_BASE="${MAPS_BASE:-https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/openfrontio/openfrontio@${UPSTREAM_COMMIT}/resources}"
+
+# Stand-ins for the all-rights-reserved proprietary/ font and alert sound,
+# copied from the openly licensed resources/.
+OVERRIDES=static-solo/overrides
+mkdir -p "$OVERRIDES/fonts" "$OVERRIDES/sounds/effects"
+cp resources/fonts/overpass-bold.woff "$OVERRIDES/fonts/OpenFront.ttf"
+cp resources/sounds/effects/game-start.mp3 \
+  "$OVERRIDES/sounds/effects/game-start-alert.mp3"
+
+npx vite build
+node static-solo/renderIndex.mjs static "$CDN_BASE"
+
+# Drop pages that belong to openfront.io itself.
+rm -rf static/press static/ads.txt static/privacy-policy.html \
+  static/terms-of-service.html static/robots.txt
